  Release Info:
  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~

  A new era of survival horror arrives with Resident Evil Requiem, the latest
  and most immersive entry yet in the iconic Resident Evil series. Experience
  terrifying survival horror with FBI analyst Grace Ashcroft, and dive into
  pulse-pounding action with legendary agent Leon S. Kennedy. Both of their
  journeys and unique gameplay styles intertwine into a heart-stopping,
  emotional experience that will chill you to your core.

  Make sure you unpack this release and merge/overwrite the PPSA31246-app0 
  folder with the one from our release RESIDENT.EVIL.requiem.PS5-DUPLEX.
  
  Then install the pkg file from the _DUPLEX_ folder.

  This release adds the following DLC :

  * Deluxe Kit:
  - Grace's Costume: Dimitrescu
  - Grace's Costume: Film Noir
  - Leon's Costume: RE4
  - Leon's Costume: Apocalypse
  - Leon's Costume: Film Noir
  - Screen Filter: Apocalypse
  - Screen Filter: Film Noir
  - Four weapon skins including S&S M232 Weapon Skin: Apocalypse
  - Mr. Raccoon Charm
  - DSO Emblem Charm
  - Audio Pack: Raccoon City Classic
  - Files: Letters from 1998

  * Preorder Outfit Set:
  - Grace's Costume: Apocalypse

  - Costumes, weapon skins, screen filters and custom sounds can be used by 
    selecting Bonus from the title screen, then Bonus Settings.
  - Charms will be added to your inventory when you start the game, or to 
    the item/supply boxes if your inventory is already full.
  - "Letters from 1998" unlocks once a certain file in Raccoon City is 
    located. Reading all the files to the end will grant a special charm.


